hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2917","\n Narrated to us Muhammad bin Bashshar, who said: Narrated to us Yahya bin Sa'id, who said: Narrated to us Thawr, on the authority of Rashid bin Sa'd, on the authority of Abdullah bin Luhay', on the authority of Abdullah bin Qurt, who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \The greatest of days in the sight of Allah is the Day of Nahr (Eid al-Adha)"","" followed by the Day of Qarr.\"" It was presented to the Prophet ("""""
